/* 首页仪表盘 — 问候 / 今日待复习 / 继续学习 / 总体进度 / 快捷入口 */
.hm-page {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 24rpx 24rpx calc(48rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

/* ===== hero ===== */
.hm-hero {
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  padding: 36rpx 32rpx 32rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 8rpx 24rpx rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.28);
}

.hm-hero-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.hm-hero-title {
  font-size: 38rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}

.hm-streak {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 10rpx 22rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
}

.hm-streak-fire {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 1;
  margin-right: 8rpx;
}

.hm-streak-txt {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}

.hm-hero-sub {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 12rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
}

/* ===== 通用卡片 ===== */
.hm-card {
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}

.hm-label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  margin-bottom: 6rpx;
}

/* ===== 今日待复习 ===== */
.hm-due {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.hm-due-num {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
}

.hm-due-val {
  font-size: 64rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1;
}

.hm-due-unit {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  margin-left: 8rpx;
}

.hm-due-btn {
  height: 80rpx;
  padding: 0 44rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
}

/* ===== 继续学习 ===== */
.hm-cont {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.hm-cont-main {
  flex: 1;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hm-cont-text {
  display: block;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.4;
  overflow: hidden;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.hm-cont-btn {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.hm-cont-btn-txt {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #3B82F6;
}

.hm-cont-arrow {
  font-size: 36rpx;
  line-height: 1;
  margin-left: 4rpx;
}

/* ===== 总体进度环 ===== */
.hm-prog {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.hm-ring {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-right: 32rpx;
}

.hm-prog-side {
  flex: 1;
}

.hm-prog-num {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
}

.hm-prog-val {
  font-size: 48rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1;
}

.hm-prog-unit {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  margin-left: 8rpx;
}

.hm-prog-sub {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 10rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

/* ===== 快捷入口 ===== */
.hm-quick {
  display: flex;
}

.hm-qitem {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  padding: 28rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.hm-qitem + .hm-qitem {
  margin-left: 16rpx;
}

.hm-qicon {
  font-size: 44rpx;
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 14rpx;
}

.hm-qtxt {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.hm-qsub {
  margin-top: 6rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}
